---
// sungd.uk Main Landing Page
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="google-site-verification" content="VLi2Q2MCHzrYvm80ry_lSLF1AueEC0iJDzkSxVWIqY8" />
  <meta name="description" content="조성덕 — ML Engineer. 직접 쓸 도구를 만들면서 일합니다." />
  <title>sungd.uk</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon-dark.png?v=4" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon-light.png?v=4" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png?v=4" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg?v=4" />

  <!-- Fonts -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/MaruBuri-Regular.subset.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />

  <!-- Google Analytics -->
  <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-NM2EX11WS1"></script>
  <script is:inline>
    window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
    function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
    gtag('js', new Date());
    (function(){
      try {
        var m = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('me');
        if (m === '1') document.cookie = 'sd_owner=1; domain=.sungd.uk; path=/; max-age=63072000; samesite=lax; secure';
        if (m === '0') document.cookie = 'sd_owner=; domain=.sungd.uk; path=/; max-age=0; samesite=lax; secure';
      } catch (e) {}
      window.__sdOwner = /(?:^|;\s*)sd_owner=1(?:;|$)/.test(document.cookie);
    })();
    gtag('set', 'user_properties', { visitor_type: window.__sdOwner ? 'owner' : 'visitor' });
    gtag('config', 'G-NM2EX11WS1');
    gtag('config', 'GT-KT4BFVVJ');
  </script>

  <style>
    /* 한글: 제목 SUIT, 본문 마루부리. scripts/subset-fonts.sh 로 KS X 1001 2,350자만 잘라 둔 것 */
    @font-face { font-family: 'SUIT'; src: url('/fonts/SUIT-Bold.subset.woff2') format('woff2'); font-weight: 700; font-display: swap; }
    @font-face { font-family: 'SUIT'; src: url('/fonts/SUIT-ExtraBold.subset.woff2') format('woff2'); font-weight: 800; font-display: swap; }
    @font-face { font-family: 'MaruBuri'; src: url('/fonts/MaruBuri-Regular.subset.woff2') format('woff2'); font-weight: 400; font-display: swap; }
    @font-face { font-family: 'MaruBuri'; src: url('/fonts/MaruBuri-SemiBold.subset.woff2') format('woff2'); font-weight: 600; font-display: swap; }
    /* 본문 속 영문: Plus Jakarta Sans 를 알파벳에만 건다. 띄어쓰기와 문장부호는 마루부리가 맡아 문단이 명조로 읽힌다 */
    @font-face { font-family: 'Jakarta Letters'; src: url('/fonts/PlusJakartaSans-400.latin.woff2') format('woff2'); font-weight: 400; font-display: swap; unicode-range: U+0041-005A, U+0061-007A; }
    @font-face { font-family: 'Jakarta Letters'; src: url('/fonts/PlusJakartaSans-600.latin.woff2') format('woff2'); font-weight: 600; font-display: swap; unicode-range: U+0041-005A, U+0061-007A; }

    :root {
      --bg: #ffffff;
      --text-primary: #1a1a1a;
      --text-secondary: #4f4f4f;
      --text-tertiary: #9a9a9a;
      --line: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      --hover-bg: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.035);
      --marker: rgba(255, 214, 51, 0.45);
      --marker-strong: rgba(255, 214, 51, 0.8);

      /* 제목 SUIT, 본문 마루부리, 영문 Plus Jakarta Sans, 숫자 Geist Mono */
      --font-sans: "Plus Jakarta Sans", "SUIT", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Apple SD Gothic Neo", sans-serif;
      --font-serif: "Jakarta Letters", "MaruBuri", serif;
      --font-mono: "Geist Mono", Menlo, monospace;
      color-scheme: light dark;
    }

    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --bg: #090a0c;
        --text-primary: #f4f4f5;
        --text-secondary: #a1a1aa;
        --text-tertiary: #71717a;
        --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        --hover-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        --marker: rgba(255, 214, 51, 0.3);
        --marker-strong: rgba(255, 214, 51, 0.55);
      }
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    
    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      line-height: 1.75;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    }

    /* Container: 단일 수직 축 */
    .page-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 540px;
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 72px 24px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .nowrap {
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* Profile Header */
    .profile-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }
    .profile-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .header-sites {
      padding-top: 9px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--text-tertiary);
    }
    .site-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.15s ease;
    }
    .site-link:hover {
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }
    .site-icon {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      opacity: 0.75;
      transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
      vertical-align: -1px;
    }
    .site-link:hover .site-icon {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    .avatar {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--card-bg, #ffffff);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      .avatar {
        filter: invert(1) brightness(0.9);
      }
    }
    .meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2px;
    }
    .name-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .name-ko {
      font-size: 1.375rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .name-en {
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--text-tertiary);
    }
    .role-line {
      font-size: 0.84375rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    /* Signature Tagline */
    .signature-tagline {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      line-height: 1.45;
      text-indent: -0.4em;
    }
    /* 형광펜: 굵은 밑줄을 글자 뒤로 올려 기준선에서 멈추게 한다 */
    .mark,
    .bio-inline-site {
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-decoration-thickness: 0.3em;
      text-underline-offset: -0.16em;
      text-decoration-color: var(--marker);
      text-decoration-skip-ink: none;
    }
    .num {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.92em;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    /* Bio Section (Run-in Headings: Option C) */
    .bio-flow {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 28px;
    }
    .bio-p {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.85;
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }
    .lead-bold {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }
    .bio-inline-site {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 3px;
      margin-right: 2px;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-weight: 400;
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .bio-inline-site:hover {
      text-decoration-color: var(--marker-strong);
    }
    .bio-inline-site svg {
      width: 11px;
      height: 11px;
      opacity: 0.7;
      transform: translateY(1.5px);
      flex-shrink: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
    }
    .bio-inline-site:hover svg {
      opacity: 1;
    }


    /* Epilogue (순수 여백형) */
    .epilogue-wrap {
      margin-top: 64px;
    }
    .epilogue-wrap .quote-text {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 0.90625rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.8;
      word-break: keep-all;
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .epilogue-wrap .quote-author {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      color: var(--text-tertiary);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* Footer (가로선 제거, 순수 여백 피날레) */
    /* 화면이 본문보다 크면 바닥에 붙는다 */
    footer {
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 48px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .social-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .social-links a {
      color: var(--text-tertiary);
      transition: color 0.15s;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .social-links a:hover {
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }
    .social-icon {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      fill: currentColor;
    }
    .footer-domain {
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--text-tertiary);
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      transition: color 0.15s;
    }
    .footer-domain:hover {
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }

    /* 폰에선 글자를 작게 해 한 화면에 더 많이 보인다 (public/style.css 와 같은 값) */
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      html { font-size: 13px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .page-wrap { padding: 32px 20px calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
      .profile-header {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }
      .header-sites { padding-top: 0; }
      .bio-flow { gap: 24px; }
      .avatar {
        width: 52px;
        height: 52px;
        border-radius: 13px;
      }
      .name-ko {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
      }
      .signature-tagline {
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .epilogue-wrap {
        margin-top: 48px;
      }
      footer { padding-top: 40px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="page-wrap">
    
    <!-- Profile Header -->
    <header class="profile-header">
      <div class="profile-left">
        <img class="avatar" src="/avatar.jpg?v=3" alt="조성덕" />
        <div class="meta">
          <div class="name-row">
            <h1 class="name-ko">조성덕</h1>
            <span class="name-en">Sungduk Cho</span>
          </div>
          <div class="role-line">
            <span>ML Engineer</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="header-sites" aria-label="Sister sites">
        <a href="https://dev.sungd.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-link" title="직접 만든 도구 & 시스템">
          <svg class="site-icon" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"></line></svg>
          <span>dev</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://ai.sungd.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-link" title="매일 써보는 AI 도구 큐레이션">
          <svg class="site-icon" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"/></svg>
          <span>ai</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://writing.sungd.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-link" title="독서 & 사유 에세이">
          <svg class="site-icon" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.376 3.622a1 1 0 0 1 3.002 3.002L7.368 18.635a2 2 0 0 1-.855.506l-2.872.838a.5.5 0 0 1-.62-.62l.838-2.872a2 2 0 0 1 .506-.854z"/></svg>
          <span>writing</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/cv/" class="site-link" title="전체 이력서 & 논문">
          <svg class="site-icon" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line></svg>
          <span>cv</span>
        </a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- 시그니처 앵커 -->
    <div class="signature-tagline">“직접 쓸 <span class="mark">도구</span>를 만들면서 일합니다.”</div>

    <!-- Bio 3문단 (런인 헤드라인 C) -->
    <main>
      <div class="bio-flow">
        <p class="bio-p">
          <strong class="lead-bold">의료영상 AI를 연구하고 제품으로 만듭니다. </strong>
          뷰노에서 <span class="num">4</span>년간 흉부 <span class="nowrap">X-ray</span>와 폐 CT 소견 모델을 개발하며, 여러 연구가 재사용하는 DB 기반 파이프라인과 자동 평가 체계를 세웠습니다. 
          단지 지표 몇 개를 높이는 것보다, 제품 관점에서 실제로 배포·최적화되고 팀이 반복 없이 안정적으로 실험할 수 있는 엔지니어링 기반을 다질 때 가장 큰 희열을 느낍니다. 
          함께 의미 있는 일을 즐겁게 해나갈 수 있는 동료이고 싶습니다. 
          전체 경력은 <a href="/cv/" class="bio-inline-site" title="전체 이력서 & 논문"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line></svg><span>cv</span></a>에서 확인하실 수 있습니다.
        </p>

        <p class="bio-p">
          <strong class="lead-bold">내 생각과 인지 방식에 딱 맞춘 도구를 직접 깎아 씁니다. </strong>
          일상의 마찰을 줄이고 작업 속도를 증강(augment)하기 위해, 터미널 세션 모니터부터 개발 콘솔, AI 에이전트 작업 공간까지 삶과 일에 필요한 시스템을 직접 지어 씁니다. 
          단정한 도구와 시각적 질서가 생각의 속도를 높여준다고 믿습니다. 
          직접 만든 도구와 엔지니어링 노트는 <a href="https://dev.sungd.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bio-inline-site" title="직접 만든 도구 & 시스템"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"></line></svg><span>dev</span></a>에, 매일 써보는 최신 AI 도구 큐레이션은 <a href="https://ai.sungd.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bio-inline-site" title="매일 써보는 AI 도구 큐레이션"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"/></svg><span>ai</span></a>에 기록합니다.
        </p>

        <p class="bio-p">
          <strong class="lead-bold">일하지 않을 때는 책을 읽고 사유하며 글을 남깁니다. </strong>
          인생을 어떻게 살고 일을 어떻게 해야 하는가에 대한 고민은 결국 엔지니어링과 맞닿아 있습니다. 
          책과 생각에 대해 쓴 글들은 <a href="https://writing.sungd.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bio-inline-site" title="독서 & 사유 에세이"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.376 3.622a1 1 0 0 1 3.002 3.002L7.368 18.635a2 2 0 0 1-.855.506l-2.872.838a.5.5 0 0 1-.62-.62l.838-2.872a2 2 0 0 1 .506-.854z"/></svg><span>writing</span></a>에 남기고 있습니다.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Epilogue (순수 여백형) -->
    <div class="epilogue-wrap">
      <p class="quote-text">
        “어떤 점도 앞을 내다보며 연결할 수는 없다.<br />
        지난 점들은 오직 뒤를 돌아볼 때만 연결된다.”
      </p>
      <span class="quote-author">— Steve Jobs</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
      <div class="social-links">
